// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`contractDocs > writes one plain-text page from the contract 1`] = `
"# notes

A short note that can be sent once.

## Records

Note
  id: string
  body: string
  state: draft | sent

## States

Note.state is one of draft, sent, and starts at draft.
  send: draft -> sent
A move that isn't listed is refused with MOVE_NOT_ALLOWED (409).

## Commands

notes.write (write)
  Write a note.
  Needs: notes.write
  Input: body: string; requestId: string
  Output: Note
  Fails: only with the pipeline's own errors
  Emits: written
  Bot tool: yes
  Command line: notes write

notes.send (write)
  Send a note.
  Needs: notes.send
  Input: id: string; requestId: string
  Output: Note
  Moves: send, draft -> sent
  Fails: NOT_FOUND (404) No such note; MOVE_NOT_ALLOWED (409) when the current state isn't one it moves from
  Bot tool: no (Covered by a unit test only)
  Command line: no (Covered by a unit test only)

## Events

notes.written on notes:{id} and notes:{state}
  A note was written.
  Payload: Note

## Retries

A write command takes a requestId. The module keeps each id with the first call's result for 1 hour, for each caller, next to its own state.
A call with an id it still keeps, at the same time or later, gets the first result and publishes no event. A call that failed keeps nothing, so a retry runs again.
"
`;
